    <dc:description>Interactive EPUB 3 on sp hybridisation and σ and π bonds in ethyne (Chemistry, final year of the Greek Lyceum), with 3D models, videos, interactive figures and questions with immediate feedback. English translation of Greek edition 3.0 (accessible 3D models, energy diagrams for sp, sp² and sp³); a translated derivative that requires verification.</dc:description>
